Sanctions:
PSPs that fail to comply with obligations under PBI 10/2025 are subject to administrative sanctions, which may include:
a. Written warning;
b. Partial or full restrictions on activities, products, and/or services;
c. Partial or full suspension of activities, products, and/or services;
d. Dismissal of management;
e. Administrative fine (denda);
f. Revocation of product/service licence; and/or
g. Revocation of business licence (licence/designation).

BI may also require remedial actions, impose increased supervisory intensity, or escalate enforcement where systemic or repeated non-compliance is identified.

